      <script name="schema:software-application" type="application/ld+json">
        {"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Yalla - Play Game &amp; Voice Chat","description":"Play, Chat, and Connect – All in One Place!\nLooking for a fun, engaging way to play games and chat with friends? Yalla brings together casual games and voice chat rooms, creating an unmatched social experience. Whether you're a fan of classic games or love connecting with new people, we’ve got you covered!\n\nKey Features:\nCasual Games to Enjoy Anytime\n- Play popular games like Ludo, Carrom, UMO, and Baloot with friends or other players worldwide.\n- Immerse yourself in friendly competitions, challenge players worldwide, and climb the leaderboards to prove your skills.\n- Stay tuned—more exciting games are coming soon!\n\nVoice Chat Rooms\n- Join voice chat rooms to talk, laugh, and make new friends. Thousands of voice chat rooms are waiting for you.\n- Go on the mic, send messages in chat, or exchange virtual gifts to enhance the fun.\n- Play mini-games directly in the room for a lively group experience.\n\n1-on-1 Private Chat\n- Connect deeper with friends through private chat. Share messages, voice notes, and more in a personal space.\n\nPost and Share\n- Share your thoughts, game achievements, or fun moments with the community posts feature. Let others know what you're up to!\n\nWhy Choose Our App?\n- All-in-One Experience: Play games, chat, and socialize in one seamless app.\n- Global Community: Meet and interact with people from around the world.\n- Fun and Interactive: Voice chat, gifts, and games make every moment exciting.\n\nFollow us to get the latest news, updates and events:\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/YallaVoiceChatRooms\nWebsite: www.yalla.live\nDear YALLA users, your feedback and suggestions are welcome to: yallasupport@yalla.com","screenshot":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/99/7f/b7/997fb7ab-c2d9-428c-c18e-94544862afdf/en-1.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/00/e1/30/00e130a8-44cb-6821-1435-1e389dfd8d77/en-2.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/31/cb/f1/31cbf1c4-5890-4287-c83a-451cd29885bc/en-3.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/19/03/d1/1903d118-9cae-ef7f-5231-527f4b9be275/en-4.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/c8/3d/e9/c83de98d-92c1-f9ef-983e-bb1ba66d141a/en-5.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/93/ce/63/93ce63ce-2acf-a362-28f5-a2f4f4138771/a00c086a-ef5e-4a33-9a7c-e34013d1cc15__U82f1_U8bed.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/29/a3/06/29a306d8-0325-2ab3-cacc-bcbf74f8e89e/4b6ca097-e775-4316-af46-15afa7cec6aa_en-1.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/dc/8f/22/dc8f2267-685a-43a3-1652-59fde3c2402c/2b6271a5-730b-42a6-8cdb-8e503c4c11a8_en-2.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/b5/60/df/b560df4c-bb4f-326c-83e6-cf2c93345296/49983b1e-b7fb-453f-b586-46759093c5b6_en-3.jpg/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/52/e6/36/52e6362c-1f4a-4409-af01-8c34c8750e03/7cfe4dea-b800-4097-b816-ec75e7a8c92d_en-5.jpg/300x0w.jpg"],"image":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/f9/8e/85/f98e8556-49b7-2906-6447-d67769ff47c1/AppIcon-Yalla-0-0-1x_U007ephone-0-1-0-sRGB-85-220.png/1200x630wa.png","applicationCategory":"Divertissement","datePublished":"19 avr. 2016","operatingSystem":"Nécessite iOS 13.0 ou une version ultérieure. Compatible avec l’iPhone, l’iPad et l’iPod touch.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC","url":"https://apps.apple.com/fr/developer/yalla-technology-fz-llc/id1444567250"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.2,"reviewCount":159},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":0,"priceCurrency":"EUR","category":"free"}}
      </script>

