tps://apps.apple.com/fr/app/yalla-match-vogue-star/id6444792857\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":5,\"ratingCount\":1,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,0,1],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"5.0 étoiles\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.5\",\"name\":\"Yalla Match - Vogue Star\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Casse-tête\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Nécessite iOS 13.0 ou version ultérieure.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Nécessite iOS 13.0 ou version ultérieure.\"},\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Nécessite iPadOS 13.0 ou version ultérieure.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"[FASHION QUEEN RISING]\\nBetrayed by the Fiance? Destroy the Cheater and Rise to Fame!\\nBackstabbed by the Fake Friend? Reclaim the Glory with the Match-3 Magic!\\n\\nCREATE FASHION MAGIC AT YOUR FINGERTIPS\\n1000+ Stunning Levels | Creative Dye Spray Effect\\nZero Ads | Play Offline Anytime\\nDress-Up Meets Match-3 Games | Story-Driven Gameplay\\n\\nMILLIONS OF OUTFITS IN THE WARDROBE AWAITS\\n3000+ Trendy Styles: Make the Character from Nobody to Fashion Icon\\nExclusive Style Battles: Outshine Villains with Show-Stopping Looks!\\n\\nDUAL STORYLINES PACKED WITH DRAMA\\n[CAREER PATH] Overcome Copycats → Rise from the Ashes → Conquer Four Major Fashion Weeks\\n[ROMANCE PATH] Reunite with First Love VS Fall for a Mysterious Designer\\n\\nDownload Now and Begin Your Journey to Fashion Royalty!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 metal \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and experience improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-05\",\"releaseTimesta